# The infinity trigger targets the Bolted Ornithopter in Bot1's graveyard; in response Bot2 sacrifices its Soul-Guide Lantern to
# exile Bot1's graveyard, so the target is gone and the ability does nothing as it resolves (CR 608.2b): the Ornithopter does not
# return (it would be a new object in exile anyway, CR 400.7). Bot1's other Ornithopter was exiled to harness the Stone.

